ob close gestures are Obsidian Ctrl+Enter, `bob capture` [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]`!note:id`, and the `=x…` / `=!` Pomodoro closes. The slot is right[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]after the predecessor's Task Link, or the same-name continuation [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]when the whole session closed. One grouped notice says what was [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]linked, where, and why: a card in Obsidian, the live preview plus [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]one notification line in Bob Mac Capture, and rows in the CLI. [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]Capture gets faster, not slower: on apollo, plain and `=x` previews[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]take ≤ 40 ms, and closing a real prerequisite takes ≤ 70 ms.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim] Counts: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]11[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]5[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plan:202610/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]successor_links.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202610/successor_links.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]bob-cli-5w[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/bobs-org/bob-cli--beads/blob/main/pages/bob-cli-5w/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Lazy, shared, prefiltered vault snapshot for capture [/bold #D7AFFF]         [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n      [bold #D7AFFF](bob-cli-5v)[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]snapshot[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]snapshot: in bob-cli, fix bead bob-cli-5v. Make DependencyContext lazy [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]and resolve `!` and `&` notes from a walk-only index. Replace the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]full-vault recovery base with one batch-scoped, parallel, prefiltered [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]dependents snapshot overlaid with staged text, and gate `!` recovery on [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]`\\[id::]`. Output is unchanged apart from the documented gate edge. Ships[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]guard tests and apollo timings.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Specify Successor Links once, in docs and vectors[/bold #D7AFFF]             [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]contract[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]contract: in bob-cli docs, add task-dependencies §12 (rule, anchors, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]placement, writes, reporting model, copy) plus §11.6 SL and SB vectors, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]with SB pinned by a Rust unit test. Rewrite the capture.md `!`, close, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]JSON, and human-output contracts. Document `plan.link_unblocked` and nav[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]`api.notice`.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Successor planner and `!note:id` wiring in bob capture[/bold #D7AFFF]        [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]capture_complete[dim] · [dim][/dim]after snapshot, contract[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]capture_complete: in bob-cli, add the pure successor planner [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF](graph-transition eligibility, anchors, ordering, breaker, minting, link[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]form, placement) and the `plan.link_unblocked` config key. Wire the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]planner into `!note:id` before ledger retirement. Extend `unblocked[]`, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]add `still_blocked` and `unblocked_check` plus the top-level `day_file`.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]Add human rows, help text, and SL tests.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Recovery and successor links inside Pomodoro closes[/bold #D7AFFF]           [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]capture_close[dim] · [dim][/dim]after capture_complete[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]capture_close: in bob-cli, run recovery and successor linking in every [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]close that completes tasks: `=x` embeds, `=x!M`, `=!`, and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]`^route:id=x…`. Successors go into the same-name continuation, created [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]when needed. Add `pomodoro_close.unblocked` and the `pomodoro_blocks` [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]line `reason`, report the net batch result, and update help text and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]tests.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  5 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Successor Links in Bob Mac Capture previews and notifications[/bold #D7AFFF] [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]mac[dim] · [dim][/dim]after capture_close[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]mac: in bob-mac-capture, decode the additive successor JSON defensively.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]Render successors in the `!` and close previews: destination capsule, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]minted-ID caption, reasons, and muted still-blocked rows. Badge [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]unblocked lines in block diffs, add one notification line, and fix Open [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]Note(s). Ships real-bob fixtures, tests, a README update, and green [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]macOS CI.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  6 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]The Unblocked notice card and nav `api.notice`[/bold #D7AFFF]                [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]nav_card[dim] · [dim][/dim]after contract[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]nav_card: in bob-navigation-hotkeys, add the Unblocked notice card in a [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]new fragment: `is-unblock` styles on existing tokens, clickable rows, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]chips, and breaker and failure variants. Expose it as the additive [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]`api.notice` v1. Ships tests, a version bump, a README update, and a [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]sync.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  7 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Pure successor helpers in task-status-cycler[/bo